{"4537730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tomo Cafe", "steam_appid": 4537730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After taking over your grandfather's study cafe, you meet some interesting regulars — four characters who somehow focus better when you're sitting there too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you study with them. As the hours add up, they start telling you stories they don't usually tell anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You help them focus. They keep you company. Little by little, you all become a little more whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomo Cafe is yours now. Ready for the new chapter? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus Together</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down for a first-person focus session beside whoever's in the cafe that day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring productivity tools including Pomodoro timer, to-do list, sticky notes, and streaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute you focus earns Yuan Stones, which unlock the next piece of someone's story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story only moves when you study.</strong> Real hours are the only currency that counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/c15361627d17e9d4e3639c5c17137fd9.poster.avif?t=1788322116\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/c15361627d17e9d4e3639c5c17137fd9.webm?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/c15361627d17e9d4e3639c5c17137fd9.mp4?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Regulars</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four original characters, each with their own ambitions, problems, and baggage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 100 stories across the four of them. Read one or two as you catch a break between focus sessions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story features 3D visual-novel stories with 2D portraits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear storytelling with choices. No wrong answers and no bad endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/67ed6657d7f588da75fcba729cd2d117.poster.avif?t=1788322116\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/67ed6657d7f588da75fcba729cd2d117.webm?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/67ed6657d7f588da75fcba729cd2d117.mp4?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You, As You</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play in first person, as yourself. No avatar to build and no gender to pick. The person at that table is youself. Make decisions like how <i>you</i> would do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your real work alongside the game — homework, coding, drawing, or whatever's on your plate today.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/71a9d556de47680c7ed08855d0cbe9cf.poster.avif?t=1788322116\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/71a9d556de47680c7ed08855d0cbe9cf.webm?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/71a9d556de47680c7ed08855d0cbe9cf.mp4?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Cafe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your cafe menu, discover recipes, and make money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your cafe with furniture and watch the customers interact with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt stray dogs and cats. Yes, you can pet them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny ambient chitchat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After taking over your grandfather's study cafe, you meet some interesting regulars — four characters who somehow focus better when you're sitting there too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you study with them. As the hours add up, they start telling you stories they don't usually tell anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You help them focus. They keep you company. Little by little, you all become a little more whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomo Cafe is yours now. Ready for the new chapter? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus Together</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down for a first-person focus session beside whoever's in the cafe that day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring productivity tools including Pomodoro timer, to-do list, sticky notes, and streaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute you focus earns Yuan Stones, which unlock the next piece of someone's story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story only moves when you study.</strong> Real hours are the only currency that counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 