table is youself. Make decisions like how <i>you</i> would do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your real work alongside the game — homework, coding, drawing, or whatever's on your plate today.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/71a9d556de47680c7ed08855d0cbe9cf.poster.avif?t=1788322116\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/71a9d556de47680c7ed08855d0cbe9cf.webm?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/extras/71a9d556de47680c7ed08855d0cbe9cf.mp4?t=1788322116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Cafe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your cafe menu, discover recipes, and make money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your cafe with furniture and watch the customers interact with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt stray dogs and cats. Yes, you can pet them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny ambient chitchat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Tomo Cafe is a cozy &quot;study-with-me&quot; game where your real life focus time moves the story forward. Work through your actual to-do list beside the regulars at your study cafe, decorate the place, and unlock the next chapter of heartwarming stories.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537730/b3283e86585235e64e4718840d8924c3ca4165ab/header.jpg?t=1788322116", "capsule_image": "https://shar